sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Her
  participant App as App (phone)
  participant Cat as Catalog
  participant Src as Sources
  participant LR as LRCLIB
  participant AI as AI model
  Her->>App: touches a search result
  App->>Cat: prewarm song(songId) on touchstart
  Her->>App: taps it, /songs/$songId
  App->>Cat: song(songId), live query
  Cat-->>App: Song, no sheets, fill idle
  App->>Cat: open(songId)
  Cat->>Cat: no fill row yet: insert running, schedule fill
  Cat->>Src: lyricsFor(song)
  Src->>LR: GET /api/get, title, artist, album, duration
  LR-->>Src: record with plain and synced lyrics
  Src-->>Cat: Lyrics + provenance
  Cat->>Cat: store Lyrics once per Song
  Cat-->>App: pushed: words-only sheet, fill running
  Cat->>Src: chordsFor(song, lyrics)
  Src->>Src: builtIn: null, ChoCo: null
  Src->>AI: place chords over these lines
  AI-->>Src: chords per line and word
  Src-->>Cat: ChordDraft: chord layer, origin ai, provenance
  Cat->>Cat: Sheet.compose(lyrics, layer), store Chord sheet "AI draft"
  Cat-->>App: pushed: Chord sheet, fill done
  App->>App: Sheet.parse, apply her transpose and capo
